<report>
<title>Risk analysis (retrospective)</title>
<table>
<tr><th></th><td colspan="2"><subtotal>Characteristic factor:</subtotal></td></tr>
<tr><td><subtotal>Outcome:</subtotal></td><td>Present</td><td>Absent</td></tr>
<tr><td>Positive</td><td>@aa</td><td>@bb</td></tr>
<tr><td>Negative</td><td>@cc</td><td>@dd</td></tr>
</table>

<p>Observed odds ratio = @{odds:roundu}<br />
Approximate power @pwr</p>
<block name="power">

<p><ci>Approximate (Woolf, logit) @{ci:roundu}% confidence interval = @{ci_1:roundu}  to  @{ci_2:roundu} </ci></p>

</block>
<p>Conditional maximum likelihood estimates:<br />
Conditional estimate of odds ratio = @{eor:roundu}<br />
<ci>Exact Fisher @pc% confidence interval = @{llf:roundu}  to  @{ulf:roundu}</ci><br />
<pval>Exact Fisher one sided @{p1f:pval}, two sided @{p2f:pval}</pval><br />
<ci>Exact mid-P @pc% confidence interval = @{llm:roundu}  to  @{ulm:roundu}</ci><br />
<pval>Exact mid-P one sided @{p1m:pval}, two sided @{p2m:pval}</pval></p>

<block name="risk">
<p>Population exposure % = @{pe:roundu}<br />
Population attributable risk % = @{par:roundu}<br />
<ci>Approximate @pc% confidence interval = @{from:roundu}  to  @{to:roundu}</ci></p>
</block>
</report>